%% description: The loop every Archer feature serves: big picture first, answer by showing, design live, keep the docs true.
flowchart LR
  %% archer-key dotted: Reused next time
  %% archer-key talk: In the conversation
  %% archer-key picture: Shown in Archer
  %% archer-key kept: Kept in Git
  question[Question or Idea]:::talk
  subgraph big_picture[Big Picture First]
    context[System Context]:::picture
    containers[Containers]:::picture
    detail[Flows and Components]:::picture
  end
  subgraph showing[Answer by Showing]
    show[Diagram with the Path Lit]:::picture
    react[Person Selects and Comments]:::talk
  end
  subgraph live[Design Together, Live]
    revise[Agent Revises the Picture]:::picture
    agreed[Agreed Picture]:::picture
  end
  subgraph knowledge[Living Knowledge Base]
    code[Code Follows]:::kept
    docs[Docs Updated with It]:::kept
  end
  question q_context@-->|Start at the top| context
  context context_containers@-->|Zoom in| containers
  containers containers_detail@-->|Zoom in| detail
  detail detail_show@-->|Point at the answer| show
  show show_react@-->|Person looks| react
  react react_revise@-->|Comments| revise
  revise revise_show@-->|Shown again| show
  react react_agreed@-->|Looks right| agreed
  agreed agreed_code@-->|Build it| code
  code code_docs@-->|Same change| docs
  docs docs_context@-.->|Next question| context
  classDef talk fill:#7e57c2,stroke:#4527a0
  classDef picture fill:#26a69a,stroke:#00695c
  classDef kept fill:#8e3b6e,stroke:#5c1f47
